            </note>
            <note corresp="#d211-f3" n="3" xml:id="d211-f3-content">
                <p>Embassy note dated January 2, 1948, not printed, conveyed to Nehru the message
                    transmitted by the Department to the Chargé in telegram 817, December 31, 1947,
                        <ref target="frus1947v03#pg_192">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1947, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>, p. 192</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d211-f4" n="4" xml:id="d211-f4-content">
                <p>Gen. Francis R. R. Bucher, Commander in Chief, Indian Army.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d211-f5" n="5" xml:id="d211-f5-content">
                <p>Sardar Baldev Singh.</p>
            </note>
